Import the C constant DBL_EPSILON as decimal from the header "float.h".
Import the C constant FLT_RADIX as integer from the header "float.h".
Import the C constant DBL_DIG as integer from the header "float.h".
Import the C constant DBL_MANT_DIG as integer from the header "float.h".
Import the C constant FLT_MAX_EXP as integer from the header "float.h".
Import the C constant DBL_MAX as decimal from the header "float.h".
Import the C constant DECIMAL_DIG as integer from the header "float.h".
Say FLT_RADIX.
Say DBL_DIG.
Say DBL_MANT_DIG.
Say FLT_MAX_EXP.
Say DECIMAL_DIG.
If DBL_EPSILON is less than 0.0001 then: Say "epsilon small". End if.
If DBL_MAX is greater than 1000000.0 then: Say "max large". End if.
